# AI Citation Optimizer — agent navigation

**Start here:** read `.cursor/skills/repo-map/SKILL.md` for the task-to-file lookup before searching the repo. Then read `docs/AGENT_CONTEXT.md` for API contracts and known bugs. Do not explore the whole repo.

## Stack

| Layer | Path | Tooling |
|-------|------|---------|
| API | `backend/app/` | FastAPI, uv, Playwright 1.63, LangChain + OpenRouter |
| UI | `frontend/src/` | React 19, Vite, TypeScript, **pnpm**, Node 22, Tailwind via `@tailwindcss/vite` |
| Infra | `docker-compose.yml` | dev: backend :8000, frontend :5173; prod: `docker-compose.prod.yml` → :8080 |

## Where to edit (common tasks)

- New/changed endpoint → `backend/app/main.py`
- Playwright audit / fix guidance → `backend/app/agent.py`
- Chat model → `backend/app/llm.py` (`OPEN_ROUTE_API_KEY`, `make_chat_model`)
- GEO checks → `backend/app/geo/` (`catalog.py` registry, `jobs.py` deep polling, `checks/`, including `mobile_parity.py` and `mobile_render.py`)
- llms.txt probe/template → `backend/app/llms_txt_analyzer.py` and `backend/app/geo/checks/llms_txt.py`
- Sitemap gaps → `backend/app/sitemap_analyzer.py`
- Peec API → `backend/app/peec_client.py`
- Dashboard / fix panel → `frontend/src/pages/Dashboard.tsx`
- Deep audit page → `frontend/src/pages/PageDetail.tsx`

## Dev commands (Docker — any OS)

```bash
docker compose up --build   # start backend + frontend
sh scripts/validate.sh      # lint + test via Docker
```

Env: `PEEC_API_KEY`, `OPEN_ROUTE_API_KEY` in root `.env`. Do not print secret values.

